/* 贝利收账 / 8阶段旧账支线 / 5大独有机制高难试炼 */
:: MP Bailey Biweekly Tribunal [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
<<set _rebStg to ($mpQuestBaileyRebellion or 0)>>
<<set _demand to Math.max(0, 150000 - (_rebStg * 18000))>>
<<set _demandPound to Math.round(_demand / 100)>>
<<set _compName to (($mpCompanion and $mpCompanion.name) or "同伴")>>
<<endevent>>
<<generate1>><<person1>>
孤儿院走廊顶部的白炽灯管发出轻微的电流嗡鸣。贝利站在楼梯转角处，手指按着一本黑皮账册，身后两名戴着黑皮手套的打手一左一右堵住了大门。
<<if _rebStg gte 4>>贝利的脸色比往常阴沉了几分，显然白公馆与货运站旧账外泄的风声已经传到了耳中。
<<elseif $pain gte 30 or $stress gte 5000>>你略显苍白的脸色让身旁的<<print _compName>>下意识地往你身前挡了半步。
<<else>> "查账日到了，"贝利冷漠地扫过你与<<print _compName>>，"这一期要交的是 <span class="gold">£<<print _demandPound>></span>，现在拿出来。"<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if _rebStg gte 8>>
	你们早已将贝利勾结地下钱庄的原件备份交予全镇各方势力。贝利盯着你手里的铜钥匙扣看了两秒，冷哼一声合上账册，挥手带着打手径直上了楼。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[目送贝利离去 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 14>><<pass 3>><<stress -10>><<endevent>><</link>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<if $money gte _demand>>
		<<baileyicon>><<link [[当场付清这一期的账 £<<print _demandPound>> (0:04)|MP Bailey Biweekly Pay]]>><<set $money -= _demand>><<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 14>><<pass 4>><<stress -4>><</link>><<lstress>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<fisticon>><<link [[跨前替同伴扛下皮鞭 (0:18)|MP Bailey Biweekly Shield]]>><<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 14>><<pass 18>><<pain 32>><<stress 10>><<willpower 4>><</link>><<ggpain>><<gstress>><<gwillpower>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<<trialicon>><<link [[推倒衣柜联手反击打手 (0:15)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers]]>><<pass 15>><<def 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if $skulduggery gte 550>>
		<<sneakicon>><<link [[拿改写银票蒙混过关 (0:06)|MP Bailey Biweekly Bluff]]>><<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 14>><<pass 6>><<skulduggery 4>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<badendicon>><<link [[交不出钱，被押往地下训诫室 (0:12)|MP BadEnd Bailey Basement]]>><<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 14>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Bailey Biweekly Pay [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
你将点好的钞票拍在贝利摊开的掌心里。贝利捻过纸币边缘确认无误，用钢笔划掉本期的账，带着两名打手转身走上二楼。
<<if $money lte 10000>>口袋一下子空了大半，<<print (($mpCompanion and $mpCompanion.name) or "同伴")>>握住你的手低声道："我这几天去多接几份零工，同时加快搜集旧账，绝不再让贝利盘剥几次。"
<<else>><<print (($mpCompanion and $mpCompanion.name) or "同伴")>>松了口气，替你拍平衣袖上的褶皱，与你低声商议起下一处旧账线索。<</if>>
<<run window.dolmp && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect("bailey_pay", 4, -4, -2, 0, 0, "与你一同应付了贝利的查账", { love: 1, trust: 1 })>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<baileyicon>><<link [[顺势去通风管旁查看旧账 (0:12)|MP Quest Bailey Rebellion]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>

:: MP Bailey Biweekly Shield [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
<<set _compName to (($mpCompanion and $mpCompanion.name) or "同伴")>>
你伸手将<<print _compName>>拨到身后，迎着贝利冰冷的视线往前跨了一步。沉重的黑皮鞭落在你的肩背上，火辣辣的痛楚令你指节发白，但你死死咬住嘴唇没有退后半寸，直到贝利收起账册离去。
<<if $pain gte 50>><<print _compName>>眼圈通红地冲上来扶住摇晃的你，颤抖着从口袋里掏出芦荟伤药替你涂抹淤青："下次绝不许你再一个人硬扛了。"
<<else>><<print _compName>>连忙用温热的毛巾替你擦去额角冷汗，小心翼翼地扶着你靠坐在长椅上缓气。<</if>>
<<run window.dolmp && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect("bailey_shield", 18, -6, -4, 0, 0, "心疼地替独自扛下惩戒的你上药", { love: 2, trust: 2 })>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[在搀扶下返回休息 (0:04)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon "zzz">><<link [[回卧室躺下敷药 (0:15)|Bedroom]]>><<pass 15>><<pain -10>><<stress -6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<lpain>><<lstress>>

:: MP Bailey Biweekly Bluff [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
<<if $skulduggery gte random(520, 860)>>
	你从容地取出一张盖有海事商会火漆的改装汇兑本票递过去。贝利对着走廊灯光检查了水印，没有发现异样，点点头将本票夹进了账册里。<<stress -8>><<willpower 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[与同伴不动声色地离开 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[转去宅邸街透口气 (0:04)|Domus Street]]>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	贝利的指腹在汇票边缘一搓，当场识破了未干透的印泥，冷笑着将纸片撕碎。两名黑衣打手立刻反剪住你的双臂，将你押向地下室楼梯。<<stress 10>><<pain 12>>
	<br><br>
	<<badendicon>><<link [[咬牙跟进地下训诫室 (0:10)|MP BadEnd Bailey Basement]]>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<fisticon>><<link [[半路踢翻烛台强行反抗 (0:12)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Quest Bailey Rebellion [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestBaileyRebellion or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
<<if _stg gte 4>>
	你翻开记满前四处暗桩的笔记本，准备追查贝利黑账的后半段下落。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[暂且收起线索返回 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续追查黑账后半段 (0:03)|MP Quest Bailey Rebellion Late]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 0>>
	贝利办公室外侧的通风铁栅松动着，里面卡着半张漏碎的双周连坐交接单。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[装作路过离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[用铁丝勾出交接单 (0:15)|MP Quest Bailey Rebellion Resolve]]>><<pass 15>><<set $mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 1>><<set $daily.mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 1>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("bailey_rebellion_stg_1")>><<set $money += 6000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<skulduggery 3>><<stress -4>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 1>>
	交接单背面印着倒钩街巡警队长私章，今晚旧证物室恰好换班。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[暂不打草惊蛇 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[潜入证物室拓印底单 (0:18)|MP Quest Bailey Rebellion Resolve]]>><<pass 18>><<set $mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 2>><<set $daily.mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 1>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("bailey_rebellion_stg_2")>><<set $money += 6000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<skulduggery 4>><<stress -5>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 2>>
	底单指向麋鹿街黑铁货运站三号装甲车，夹层里锁着两个被借调的院童；林恩已在货运站后门等你。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回暗处观察 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<fisticon>><<link [[与林恩撬开货车救人夺账 (0:20)|MP Quest Bailey Rebellion Resolve]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 3>><<set $daily.mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 1>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("bailey_rebellion_stg_3")>><<set $money += 6000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<physique 3>><<willpower 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	装甲车搜出的铜钥匙刻着高街钟表铺暗码，钥匙旁还压着一枚火漆印模，需请塞拉配制副匙。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[改日再去钟表铺 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<shopicon>><<link [[请塞拉破译火漆印模 (0:16)|MP Quest Bailey Rebellion Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<set $mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 4>><<set $daily.mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 1>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("bailey_rebellion_stg_4")>><<set $money += 6000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Quest Bailey Rebellion Late [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestBaileyRebellion or 4)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
<<if _stg is 4>>
	副匙对应多瑙河街白公馆地窖的联名保险箱，今晚正有假面沙龙。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[暂缓潜入白公馆 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<brothelicon>><<link [[借沙龙掩护取走前半本黑账 (0:22)|MP Quest Bailey Rebellion Resolve]]>><<pass 22>><<set $mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 5>><<set $daily.mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 1>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("bailey_rebellion_stg_5")>><<set $money += 6000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<danceskill 4>><<skulduggery 4>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
	贝利察觉账册失窃，派出清道夫在工业巷设伏拦截。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[绕道避开伏击圈 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<trialicon>><<link [[正面击溃清道夫夺取密信 (0:20)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 6>><<set $daily.mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 1>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("bailey_rebellion_stg_6")>><<set $money += 6000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 6>>
	密信显示后半本总账藏在孤儿院训诫室暗墙金库内。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[等准备万全再动手 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[用双匙开启贝利地下金库 (0:25)|MP Quest Bailey Rebellion Resolve]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 7>><<set $daily.mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 1>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("bailey_rebellion_stg_7")>><<set $money += 6000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<willpower 4>><<control 15>><</link>>
<<elseif _stg is 7>>
	八份核心铁证已齐，只需将副本分送市政厅与暗港备份即可斩断连坐。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[稍后再去摊牌 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<baileyicon>><<link [[将铁证拍在贝利办公桌上 (0:20)|MP Quest Bailey Rebellion Resolve]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 8>><<set $daily.mpQuestBaileyRebellion to 1>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("bailey_rebellion_stg_8")>><<set $money += 6000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<control 25>><<trauma -12>><<stress -15>><</link>>
<<else>>
	双周连坐规费已彻底废除，贝利再未踏足你们的走廊。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Quest Bailey Rebellion Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
你将新截获的贝利旧账凭证封入防水夹层，与同伴核对了下一回的联络暗号。随着把柄一件件落实，贝利每两周的盘剥已被永久削减了 <span class="gold">£<<print (($mpQuestBaileyRebellion or 1) * 180)>></span>。
<<if ($mpQuestBaileyRebellion or 0) gte 8>>从今往后，贝利再也不敢向你们索要分文。<<stress -15>><<trauma -8>>
<<else>>你把夹层藏回贴身内袋，听着外侧平稳的风声，心底多了一分底气。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回安全处 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[顺路去宅邸街巡看 (0:05)|Domus Street]]>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>


/* 精英战 1：苍白象牙怨灵（独有机制：三重水镜幻象与意志共鸣） */

:: MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Temple">><</if>>
暗红的血月光华穿透雾气，水面与石柱间浮现出三道半透明的苍白倒影。佩戴象牙项链的怨灵悬浮在石坛中央，冰冷的幽影触手封锁了台阶："同行的羔羊，在镜面迷宫里一同沉沦吧。"
<<if $willpower gte 700>>你咬破舌尖保持清醒，一眼看穿左侧两道倒影只是没有实体的水雾折射。
<<elseif $stress gte 5000>>刺骨的寒意顺着脚踝往上爬，耳边回荡着令人昏沉的低语。
<<else>>你握紧身旁同伴的手掌，借着彼此掌心的温度抵御怨灵的精神侵蚀。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<bloodmoonicon>><<link [[举防风铜灯砸碎幻象水镜 (0:12)|MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith Mirror]]>><<pass 12>><<willpower 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<trialicon>><<link [[与同伴十指紧扣激发共鸣 (0:15)|MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith Resonance]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[掀翻铜炉借浓烟撤退 (0:06)|MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith Escape]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith Mirror [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
你抓起台阶边的黄铜防风灯，迎着呼啸而来的幽影触手猛地砸向左侧积水石盘。伴随着清脆的铜镜碎裂声，两道虚假的苍白分身瞬间化作白雾消散，怨灵本体的象牙项链露出了明显的裂隙。
<<if $skulduggery gte 500 or $willpower gte 650>>你趁怨灵真身僵直的刹那欺身而上，一举扯下了那枚凝聚月华的晶簇核心。<<include "MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith Win">>
<<else>>残余的幽影触手抽打在你的肩头，刺骨的寒气令你呼吸一窒，不得不与同伴背靠背稳住阵脚。<<pain 10>><<stress 8>>
	<br><br>
	<<trialicon>><<link [[趁怨灵真身暴露全力合击 (0:10)|MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith Resonance]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[借幻象破灭的空隙突围撤离 (0:05)|MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith Escape]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith Resonance [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
<<set _power to (($willpower or 500) / 10) + (($physique or 10000) / 300) + ((window.dolmp && window.dolmp.players && window.dolmp.players.size gt 0) ? 35 : 20)>>
<<if _power + random(1, 45) gte 105>>
	你与同伴同时踏前一步，毫不退缩地直视怨灵空洞的双眸，用滚烫的血气与决绝的意志冲散了漫天红雾。<<include "MP Elite Encounter Ivory Wraith Win">>
<<else>>
	怨灵刺耳的尖啸震得你眼前发黑，冰冷的幽影触手缠住你的脚踝，将意识模糊的你拽向了地下修道院的石牢深处。<<stress 14>><<trauma 8>>
	<br><br>
	<<badendicon>><<link [[坠入地下修道院静思石牢 (0:10)|MP BadEnd Abbey Penance]]>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
