/* 精英战 5：贝利黑衣清道夫（独有机制：走廊橡木柜路障与林恩伏击哨） */

:: MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
贝利的两名黑衣清道夫甩出包铅橡胶棍，一前一后封堵了孤儿院走廊。走廊中段立着一座塞满旧床单的笨重橡木高柜，而楼梯半层平台上方隐约可见守夜人林恩潜伏的手势。
<<if $physique gte 13000>>你抵住橡木高柜侧沿，感觉凭借自己与同伴的力气完全能将其推倒截断走廊。
<<else>>走廊狭窄，一旦被两名打手同时合围将极难招架。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<fisticon>><<link [[合力推倒高柜砸翻打手 (0:12)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Barricade]]>><<pass 12>><<physique 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<trialicon>><<link [[吹响短哨引林恩跃下夹击 (0:14)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Ambush]]>><<pass 14>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[拉下电闸趁黑退回阁楼 (0:05)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Escape]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Barricade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
你与同伴同时发力猛推走廊中段的橡木高柜，沉重的柜体轰然砸落，将冲在最前面的黑衣清道夫死死压在底板下，也将另一名打手隔绝在了走廊外侧。
<<if $physique gte 12500 or $willpower gte 600>>你们趁势夺过被压打手手中的橡胶棍，两棍敲落了后方打手的武器，连同贝利的黑金收款箱一并截获。<<include "MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Win">>
<<else>>后方的打手踩着柜顶跃过障碍，但已成了孤军奋战之势。
	<br><br>
	<<trialicon>><<link [[引林恩跃下合围打手 (0:10)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Ambush]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[借着木柜阻隔退入卧室 (0:04)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Escape]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Ambush [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set _baileyScore to (($physique or 10000) / 260) + (($willpower or 500) / 10) + ((window.dolmp && window.dolmp.players && window.dolmp.players.size gt 0) ? 35 : 20)>>
<<if _baileyScore + random(1, 45) gte 100>>
	随着你一声短哨，林恩从半层楼梯纵身跃下，精准锁住后排打手的咽喉，你与同伴则合力将前排打手击倒在地。<<include "MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Win">>
<<else>>
	橡胶棍重重砸在你的肩头，剧痛令你眼前一黑失去平衡，被两名打手直接拖进了孤儿院地底的训诫室。<<pain 20>><<stress 12>>
	<br><br>
	<<badendicon>><<link [[被拖入贝利地下训诫室 (0:10)|MP BadEnd Bailey Basement]]>><<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 14>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[挣脱衣袖顺着阁楼绳梯逃脱 (0:06)|MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Escape]]>><<pass 6>><<pain 10>><</link>><<gpain>>
<</if>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Win [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
两名黑衣清道夫狼狈地倒在走廊上动弹不得。贝利冷冷地看了你们一眼，没敢再上前纠缠便退回了办公室。你不仅免除了这一期的账，还当场截获了打手随身携带的 £2,500 黑金箱！
<<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 14>>
<<if ($mpQuestBaileyRebellion or 0) lt 8>><<set $mpQuestBaileyRebellion to ($mpQuestBaileyRebellion or 0) + 1>><</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("elite_bailey_enforcers_win")>>
	<<set $money += 15000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<willpower 8>><<stress -18>><<control 25>>
<<else>>
	<<set $money += 4500>><<willpower 3>><<stress -10>><<control 10>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好战利品返回走廊 (0:04)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回卧室清点黑金箱 (0:05)|Bedroom]]>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Elite Encounter Bailey Enforcers Escape [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
你果断拉下走廊墙角的电闸，整条通道瞬间陷入漆黑。你拉着同伴借着熟悉的地形溜进侧门，将打手沉重的脚步声甩在了楼道另一头。<<stress -4>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回安全处 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[从后门溜去花园 (0:04)|Garden]]>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

